    "text": "Cenulf Mercna cyng gebette & gefreode \u00fe to Wigerna ceastre li\u00f0 on twa healfe S\u00c6FERNE XXX hida.\n& \u00c6\u00feelred & \u00c6\u00feelfl\u00e6d ge trymedon \u00fea burh & \u00fea stowe wel gegodedan mid heora \u00e6lm\u00e6ssan.\n& Nor\u00f0 Heanbyrig Wiglaf cyning gefreode & becte into mynstre, & Heortlanbyrig Burhred cyning.\n& \u00c6lfgy\u00f0e cyrcan \u00c6\u00f0elstan cyning gebecte XX hida into Wigora ceastre.\n& Wuda tun XX hida \u00c6\u00feelbald cyning gebecte into mynstre & \u00c6\u00feelrice bet\u00e6hte.\n& Hamtun Offa cyng gebecte XVII hida & into mynstre Gode to lofe ge u\u00f0e.\n& Str\u00e6tford Byrhtulf cyng gebecte & on Godes est Heabyrhte bisceope bet\u00e6hte XX hida.\n& Tredingtun XXX hida Eanbyrht cyning gebecte & bet\u00e6hte Milrede bisceope.\n& Bloccan lea Burhred cyning gebecte & gefreode & bet\u00e6hte Alhwine bisceope L hida.\n& Speoles byrig Byrhtulf cyng gebecte XV hida & on Godes est Heabyrhte bisceope bet\u00e6hte.\n& \u00e6t Wyrigtune Offa cyng gebecte XLV hida mit \u00feam \u00e6t Fiscesburnan & Milrede bisceope bet\u00e6hte on\nWestbyrig & Stoc \u00c6\u00feelric becw\u00e6\u00f0 into Wigora ceastre, & Offa cyng hit gebecte \u00e6rest \u00c6\u00feelmunde,\n& Beaganbyrig Burhred cyng gebecte into Wigera ceastre, \u00fe is be Culne X hida & \u00e6t Pultune VIII & \u00e6t\n\u00c6t Colesburnan VIII hida Deneberht bisceop al\u00e6nde Balthune.",
